# Core

Read `AGENTS.md` before changing architecture, editions, auth, or Office.js I/O.

- Four tabs only: assistant, review, draft, tools. Cross-feature handoffs extend `AppIntent` in `src/app/nav.tsx` and call `clearIntent()` once. Do not add a fifth primary tab unless asked.
- `@/` maps to `src/`. Hosted vs community is `isCommunity()` in `src/community/edition.ts`. Feature modules stay edition-agnostic; route through `src/api/` so the community shim can intercept.
- Change gate: `npm run type-check` and `npm run build`. Backend edits: `cd backend && pytest -q`.
- Do not commit, push, or amend unless the user explicitly asks in this turn.
- Check `git status` before assuming a feature is landed.
- Immutability: create new objects. Small files. Validate user input.
- US spelling. No emojis. No em dashes. White theme only.
- Hosted in-app copy: say "HakiChain AI", do not name model vendors. Community Settings / KeyWizard may name providers. Never put `service_role` in the pane or Vite/Docker pane build args.
